<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE - Washington St. Housing at 1215 EDT.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE - Washington St. Housing at 1215 EDT.</headline>
<text>
<p>WASHINGTON STATE HOUSING FINANCE COMMISSION</p>
<p>RE: $34,525,000</p>
<p>SINGLE-FAMILY PROGRAM BONDS,</p>
<p>1997 SERIES 2A (AMT)</p>
<p>1997 SERIES 2N (NON-AMT)</p>
<p>1997 SERIES 2T (TAXABLE)</p>
<p>Effective at 12:15 P.M. E.D.T., Monday, April 14, 1997</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Seattle-First National Bank</p>
<p>Siebert, Brandford, Shank &amp; Co.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
